   "stem_html": "The increased need for slave labor during the first quarter of the nineteenth century led to",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1168256,
     "content_html": "the rapid development of an abolitionist movement"
    },
    {
     "id": 1168257,
     "content_html": "a growing debate over where slavery could exist in the United States"
    },
    {
     "id": 1168255,
     "content_html": "slowed industrialization in the North"
    },
    {
     "id": 1168254,
     "content_html": "a call to continue the importation of slave labor from Africa"
    }
